{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "f817e0403277449884c2d4f4ddf9febc", "name": "98", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The TVDI files have been computed and saved at the following paths:\n- `/home/egm/Desktop/Earth-Agent/evaluate_langchain/mistral_AP_26-07-03_11-22/out/benchmark/data/question98/tvdi_2023-08-13.tif`\n- `/home/egm/Desktop/Earth-Agent/evaluate_langchain/mistral_AP_26-07-03_11-22/out/benchmark/data/question98/tvdi_2023-08-29.tif`\n\nNext, I will use the `threshold_segmentation` tool to identify all pixels with TVDI > 0.7."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "Tocq6iPmy", "name": "threshold_segmentation", "input": {"input_image_path": "/home/egm/Desktop/Earth-Agent/evaluate_langchain/mistral_AP_26-07-03_11-22/out/benchmark/data/question98/tvdi_2023-08-13.tif", "threshold": 0.7, "output_path": "benchmark/data/question98/tvdi_2023-08-13_threshold.tif"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "z2MNTWZGP", "name": "threshold_segmentation", "input": {"input_image_path": "/home/egm/Desktop/Earth-Agent/evaluate_langchain/mistral_AP_26-07-03_11-22/out/benchmark/data/question98/tvdi_2023-08-29.tif", "threshold": 0.7, "output_path": "benchmark/data/question98/tvdi_2023-08-29_threshold.tif"}}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 21:08:27"}
