{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "ef11e826814f4244985f758d33cea6bc", "name": "130", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now that I have the NDSI values for January 1st, 2020, and January 1st, 2022, I need to compute the difference (ΔNDSI) between these values to determine the trend and snow cover changes.\n\nI will use the `compute_linear_trend` function to calculate the trend based on the NDSI values."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "TXkRmDJgX", "name": "compute_linear_trend", "input": {"y": [0.45, 0.441]}}], "metadata": null, "timestamp": "2026-07-03 23:44:58"}
