{"__module__": "langchain.schema.messages", "__name__": "ChatMessage", "id": "1e48926f743746b5a5fe9cf54861e213", "name": "153", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Now that we have the list of files, we will calculate the proportion of areas above the NDVI mean for the specified dates. We will use the `calculate_threshold_ratio` function for this purpose. Let's proceed with the calculations."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "xriWka6Mj", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-03-06.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "HO88xIrX5", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-06-10.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "YdZjR1poO", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-05-25.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "fsmp0edOj", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-02-02.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "vME0ZK8GK", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-07-12.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "uteoi2izN", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-03-22.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "JQFeu0N0V", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-04-07.tif", "threshold": 0.75, "mode": "above"}}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "fmeoinH65", "name": "calculate_threshold_ratio", "input": {"image_paths": "benchmark/data/question153/Indian_NDVI.tif_2021-06-26.tif", "threshol